[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17821.59, "timestamp": "04:57:01", "text": "就像棕色巧克力一样，有黑巧克力。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17824.47, "timestamp": "04:57:04", "text": "比如，哦，所有这些东西。哦，不是那个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17826.23, "timestamp": "04:57:06", "text": "顺便说一句，那是健康向上的那种。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17828.39, "timestamp": "04:57:08", "text": "别担心。实际存在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17832.23, "timestamp": "04:57:12", "text": "用干泥巴做的泥饼。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17836.07, "timestamp": "04:57:16", "text": "全是粘土。我到底在说什么？干泥。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17838.948, "timestamp": "04:57:18", "text": "这是一项儿童活动或游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17841.35, "timestamp": "04:57:21", "text": "等待。哦。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17844.948, "timestamp": "04:57:24", "text": "哦，是这个。我懂了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17847.99, "timestamp": "04:57:27", "text": "我刚用谷歌搜了一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17850.15, "timestamp": "04:57:30", "text": "我先看到的是那个很纯真的人。我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17853.11, "timestamp": "04:57:33", "text": "比如，“哦，等等，这很黑暗”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17856.55, "timestamp": "04:57:36", "text": "不过巧克力倒是挺好吃的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17859.11, "timestamp": "04:57:39", "text": "黑巧克力。为什么会这样？哦，等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17863.43, "timestamp": "04:57:43", "text": "Vic Oh，Vic 是不是特别有钱？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17866.23, "timestamp": "04:57:46", "text": "就像Doc Chop是穷人的馅饼一样？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17868.708, "timestamp": "04:57:48", "text": "真的很大。你要炫耀一番，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17870.948, "timestamp": "04:57:50", "text": "然后你看到了，然后你的电量就降到了两档。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17873.75, "timestamp": "04:57:53", "text": "第二。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17877.11, "timestamp": "04:57:57", "text": "贫穷的忏悔。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17879.83, "timestamp": "04:57:59", "text": "再次抱歉。我堕入黑暗面了。我是"}]